The test failed because the service provider is missing a registration for Orleans.Storage.IGrainStorageSerializer, which is required by DefaultStorageProviderSerializerOptionsConfigurator used in AddDynamoDBGrainStorage.

I will add a mock or dummy registration for IGrainStorageSerializer to the service collection before calling AddDynamoDBGrainStorage to satisfy this dependency.

I will resubmit the test with this fix.

